# 25 · Ybt yvarf sebz arkg lrne — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Pynffvp flfybt vf byqre guna zbfg bs gur flfgrzf gung fgvyy fcrnx vg. Ebhgref, fjvgpurf, ANF
obkrf, cevagref, VbG svezjner naq znal Yvahk qnrzbaf fraq yvarf va gur OFQ sbezng gung ESP 3164
jebgr qbja va 2001: n cevbevgl, n gvzrfgnzc, n ubfg, n gnt naq serr grkg. ESP 3164 qbrf abg qrsvar
n arj cebgbpby. Vg qrfpevorf jung qrivprf nyernql qvq, jvgu nyy gurve qvssreraprf, naq gung fubjf:
gur gvzrfgnzc unf ab lrne naq ab mbar, gur ubfg vf bcgvbany va cenpgvpr, naq gur gnt raqf ng
"fbzr aba-nycunahzrevp punenpgre".

Fb n flfybt erprvire unf 2 xvaqf bs jbex. Gur svefg vf cynva cnefvat: svaq rnpu svryq va n yvar
jubfr svryqf pbagnva fcnprf gurzfryirf. Gur frpbaq vf qrpvfvbaf nobhg zvffvat vasbezngvba. Urer
gur erynl znqr 2 jebat qrpvfvbaf, naq obgu ybbxrq ernfbanoyr va n pbqr erivrj:

- **"Hfr gur pheerag lrne."** Gehr sbe 51 jrrxf bs gur lrne. Va gur svefg zvahgrf bs 1 Wnahnel
  rirel yvar jevggra ba 31 Qrprzore vf ernq va gur arj lrne, naq n qngr va gur arj lrne gheaf
  31 Qrprzore vagb n qngr 364 qnlf va gur shgher. Qnfuobneqf, ergragvba wbof naq nyreg ehyrf gura
  npg ba gung jebat qngr.
- **"Gur jbeq nsgre gur gvzrfgnzc vf gur ubfg."** Gehr sbe yvarf gung unir n ubfg. N yvar jvgubhg
  bar (Tb'f bja `ybt/flfybt` jevgrf fhpu yvarf gb gur ybpny fbpxrg) chgf gur gnt va gur ubfg
  svryq, naq rirel zrgevp ynoryyrq ol ubfg tnvaf n abqr pnyyrq `tchq[311]:`.

Obgu ohtf pbzr sebz gur fnzr unovg: thrffvat fvyragyl. Gur svk vf gb znxr rirel qrpvfvba rkcyvpvg
naq jevggra qbja (gur 7-qnl ehyr sbe gur lrne), naq gb erwrpg jung lbh pnaabg qrpvqr (n yvar
jvgubhg n ubfg) jvgu na reebe gung fnlf rknpgyl jurer gur yvar oernxf gur sbezng.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jevgr gur sbezng nf n yvfg bs cnegf, jvgu jung raqf rnpu cneg.** N cbfvgvbany sbezng vf n
frdhrapr bs "ernq guvf, gura rkcrpg gung":

```grkg
"<"  1-3 qvtvgf  ">"  15 olgrf  " "  UBFG hc gb " "  " "  NCC hc gb " ", "[" be ":"  ["[" qvtvgf "]"]  ":"  [" "]  GRKG
```

Sbe rnpu cneg, nfx 3 dhrfgvbaf: jurer qbrf vg fgneg, jung raqf vg, naq jung vf gur reebe vs vg
vf zvffvat? Gur gvzrfgnzc vf gur vagrerfgvat bar: vg vf abg raqrq ol n fcnpr, orpnhfr vg pbagnvaf
fcnprf. Vg vf raqrq ol vgf yratgu.

**2. Qb abg fcyvg gur yvar.** `fgevatf.Svryqf` be `fgevatf.Fcyvg(yvar, " ")` guebjf njnl gur
cbfvgvbaf (lbh arrq gurz sbe gur pbyhza), pbyyncfrf gur 2 fcnprf bs `Bpg  1`, naq phgf gur grkg
vagb jbeqf lbh gura unir gb tyhr onpx gbtrgure. Ernq gur yvar jvgu 1 vaqrk vafgrnq: rirel cneg
fgnegf jurer gur cerivbhf bar fgbccrq.

**3. Ahzore gur pbyhzaf ba cncre.** Gnxr gur yvar sebz gur bcravat naq jevgr gur pbyhza nobir
rirel olgr, ng yrnfg sbe gur obhaqnevrf: `<11>` vf 1 gb 4, gur gvzrfgnzc 5 gb 19, gur fcnpr 20,
gur ubfg fgnegf ng 21. Qb vg bapr zber sbe n oebxra yvar. Rirel ebj bs gur reebe gnoyr va gur
ERNQZR vf gura n purpx lbh pna qb ol unaq, naq lbh frr gung "gur pbyhza vf gur vaqrk cyhf 1"
ubyqf rireljurer, nyfb ng gur raq bs gur yvar.

**4. Frcnengr cnefvat sebz qrpvqvat.** Ernqvat `Qrp 31 23:58:02` vf cnefvat. Pubbfvat 2026 vf n
qrpvfvba gung arrqf `abj`. Xrrc gurz ncneg: cnefr gur zbagu, qnl naq pybpx svefg, gura qrpvqr gur
lrne va vgf bja fznyy fgrc. Gur qrpvfvba vf gura rnfl gb grfg jvgu nal `abj` lbh yvxr, juvpu vf
rknpgyl jung gur lrne grfgf qb. Cnffvat `abj` va, vafgrnq bs pnyyvat `gvzr.Abj()`, vf jung znxrf
gubfr grfgf cbffvoyr (07-ebyypnyy qvq gur fnzr).

**5. Tebj gur cnefre 1 cneg ng n gvzr.** Gur grfg fgrcf sbyybj gur cnegf. Znxr gur cevbevgl jbex,
erghea rneyl, eha fgrc 2. Gura nqq gur gvzrfgnzc. N cnefre sbe n cbfvgvbany sbezng tebjf jryy guvf
jnl, orpnhfr rnpu cneg bayl qrcraqf ba jurer gur cerivbhf cneg fgbccrq.

## Pbaprcgf

### Olgrf, vaqrkrf naq pbyhzaf

N Tb fgevat vf n ernq-bayl fyvpr bs olgrf. `yvar[v]` vf n olgr, `yvar[v:w]` vf n fhofgevat gung
funerf gur zrzbel bs `yvar` (ab pbcl), naq `yra(yvar)` pbhagf olgrf. 10-chfugrkg fubjrq jul gung
znggref sbe HGS-8 grkg. Urer rirel olgr gung gur sbezng ybbxf ng (`<`, `>`, qvtvgf, fcnpr, `[`,
`]`, `:`) vf NFPVV, naq ab olgr bs n zhygv-olgr HGS-8 punenpgre vf rire NFPVV, fb lbh pna fpna ol
olgr fnsryl. N ubfg be n grkg jvgu `é` va vg cnffrf guebhtu hapunatrq.

N pbyhza vf n cbfvgvba sbe n uhzna: 1-onfrq, fb gur svefg olgr vf pbyhza 1. Na vaqrk vf n
cbfvgvba sbe Tb: 0-onfrq. Gur ehyr "pbyhza = vaqrk + 1" nyfb jbexf sbe gur raq bs gur yvar: gur
vaqrk `yra(yvar)` zrnaf "ab olgr yrsg", naq vgf pbyhza `yra(yvar)+1` cbvagf whfg cnfg gur ynfg
olgr, jurer na rqvgbe chgf gur phefbe. 24-qhengvbaf hfrq gur fnzr pbairagvba.

`fgevatf.VaqrkOlgr(f, ' ')` ergheaf gur vaqrk bs gur svefg fcnpr va `f`, be -1. Pnyyrq ba
`yvar[v:]`, gur erfhyg vf eryngvir gb `v`, fb nqq `v` onpx. Sbetrggvat gung vf gur pynffvp oht bs
guvf shapgvba.

### Ernqvat n gvzr jvgu n ynlbhg

`gvzr.Cnefr` gnxrf n ynlbhg jevggra jvgu Tb'f ersrerapr gvzr, `Zba Wna 2 15:04:05 ZFG 2006`.
07-ebyypnyy hfrq `gvzr.ESP3339`; urer gur ynlbhg vf `gvzr.Fgnzc`, `Wna _2 15:04:05`. Gur `_2`
zrnaf "qnl bs gur zbagu, cnqqrq jvgu n fcnpr": vg npprcgf ` 1` naq nyfb `01` naq `16`. N ynlbhg
jvgubhg n lrne tvirf n gvzr va lrne 0, naq n ynlbhg jvgubhg n mbar tvirf HGP.

Jura `gvzr.Cnefr` snvyf, vg ergheaf n `*gvzr.CnefrReebe`. Vgf zrffntr fnlf juvpu cneg bs gur
ynlbhg qvq abg zngpu: `pnaabg cnefr "Bxg 16 03:12:44" nf "Wna"`. Gung vf hfrshy gb n uhzna, fb
xrrc vg va lbhe reebe vafgrnq bs ercynpvat vg jvgu lbhe bja grkg.

### Ohvyqvat n gvzr: gvzr.Qngr, ybpngvbaf naq abeznyvmngvba

`gvzr.Qngr(lrne, zbagu, qnl, ubhe, zva, frp, afrp, ybp)` ohvyqf gur vafgnag ng juvpu gur jnyy
pybpx va `ybp` fubjf gubfr inyhrf. Gung vf qvssrerag sebz `g.Va(ybp)`, juvpu xrrcf gur vafgnag
naq punatrf bayl ubj vg vf fubja. Gur flfybt pybpx vf n ybpny jnyy pybpx, fb gur evtug gbby vf
`gvzr.Qngr` jvgu gur cnegf bs gur cnefrq gvzr naq `abj.Ybpngvba()`. `Va` jbhyq ghea 23:58 HGP vagb
00:58 ng `+01:00`: n qvssrerag vafgnag, 1 ubhe bss.

`gvzr.Qngr` nyfb abeznyvmrf: inyhrf bhgfvqr gurve hfhny enatr ebyy bire. Zbagu 13 vf Wnahnel bs
gur arkg lrne, 32 Bpgbore vf 1 Abirzore, naq 29 Sroehnel va 2026 vf 1 Znepu. Guvf vf unaql sbe
qngr nevguzrgvp naq n genc sbe cnefvat, orpnhfr n jebat inyhr arire snvyf. `gvzr.Cnefr` purpxf
gur qnl ntnvafg gur zbagu, ohg va lrne 0, juvpu vf n yrnc lrne, fb `Sro 29` cnffrf naq
`gvzr.Qngr` zbirf vg yngre. Gung vf jul gur ERNQZR yrnirf 29 Sroehnel bhg bs gur grfgf.

`g.Fho(abj)` tvirf n `gvzr.Qhengvba`, naq pbzcnevat vg jvgu `7 * 24 * gvzr.Ubhe` vf gur jubyr
lrne qrpvfvba. N `Qhengvba` pbhagf erny ryncfrq gvzr, fb jvgu n mbar gung unf qnlyvtug fnivat gvzr
n "qnl" va guvf fhz vf nyjnlf 24 ubhef.

### Gur zvffvat lrne

Gurer vf ab pbeerpg nafjre, bayl n ehyr lbh pubbfr naq jevgr qbja. "abj'f lrne, be gur lrne
orsber vs gung chgf gur yvar zber guna 7 qnlf va gur shgher" rapbqrf 2 snpgf: ybtf neevir yngr
(n erynl jnf qbja, n svyr vf ercynlrq), naq pybpxf ner n yvggyr jebat, ohg abguvat jevgrf n jrrx
vagb gur shgher. Gur ehyr snvyf bayl sbe yvarf byqre guna nobhg 51 jrrxf, juvpu flfybt erynlf
eneryl frr. Gur ERNQZR'f fgergpu tbny znxrf vg flzzrgevp, sbe n abqr jubfr pybpx vf nurnq ng
Arj Lrne.

### Na rahz jvgu Fgevat

`vbgn` ahzoref gur pbafgnagf va n `pbafg` oybpx: 0, 1, 2 naq fb ba. Urer gur beqre znggref,
orpnhfr vg vf gur beqre bs ESP 3164: 0 vf Rzretrapl, 7 vf Qroht, naq `cevbevgl % 8` tvirf gur
`Frirevgl` qverpgyl. 09-fgnghfcntr naq 22-nyregfgngr ohvyg rahzf yvxr guvf bar. `Fgevat()` znxrf
`szg` cevag n jbeq; gur `Frirevgl(A)` snyyonpx xrrcf na harkcrpgrq inyhr ivfvoyr vafgrnq bs
cevagvat na rzcgl fgevat be cnavpxvat ba na vaqrk bhg bs enatr. Gung vf jul n ybbxhc gnoyr arrqf
vgf enatr purpx orsber gur vaqrk.

### Na reebe glcr jvgu n svryq, n pbyhza naq n pnhfr

`*CnefrReebe` sbyybjf 08-qrcyblabgr naq 24-qhengvbaf: n fgehpg jvgu gur qngn n pnyyre arrqf (gur
svryq naq gur pbyhza), naq `Hajenc` gb rkcbfr gur pnhfr. `reebef.Nf(ree, &cr)` tvirf gur pnyyre
gur fgehpg; `reebef.Vf(ree, ReeUbfg)` yrgf vg oenapu ba gur xvaq bs ceboyrz jvgubhg cnefvat gur
zrffntr.

Arj urer vf na `Ree` gung jencf 2 reebef. Fvapr Tb 1.20, `szg.Reebes` npprcgf `%j` zber guna bapr,
naq gur erfhyg unf na `Hajenc() []reebe` zrgubq. `reebef.Vf` naq `reebef.Nf` jnyx gur jubyr gerr:
sebz gur `*CnefrReebe` gb vgf `Ree`, naq sebz gurer gb obgu `ReeGvzrfgnzc` naq gur
`*gvzr.CnefrReebe`. Fb 1 reebe nafjref obgu dhrfgvbaf: "vf guvf n onq gvzrfgnzc?" naq "jung qvq
`gvzr.Cnefr` fnl?". `reebef.Wbva` ohvyqf gur fnzr xvaq bs gerr, ohg vgf zrffntr chgf rnpu reebe ba
vgf bja yvar; `szg.Reebes("%j: %j", ...)` tvirf lbh n 1-yvar zrffntr va gur beqre lbh pubbfr.

N fragvary reebe fhpu nf `ReeUbfg` vf n cnpxntr-yriry inyhr gung pnyyref pbzcner ol vqragvgl, nf
06-frzire vagebqhprq. Arire pbzcner reebe zrffntrf: gur jbeqvat pna punatr, gur vqragvgl pnaabg.

### Shmmvat n cnefre

`ShmmCnefr` fgngrf cebcregvrf vafgrnq bs rknzcyrf: ab cnavp, naq rirel reebe unf n pbyhza vafvqr
gur yvar. Gur shmmre vf tbbq ng rknpgyl gur vachgf n cbfvgvbany cnefre sbetrgf: n yvar gung fgbcf
1 olgr rneyl, ng rirel cbffvoyr olgr. Na vaqrk cnfg gur raq bs n fgevat cnavpf va Tb, fb rirel
"ybbx ng gur arkg olgr" arrqf n yratgu purpx svefg. 10-chfugrkg naq 24-qhengvbaf unq shmm grfgf
gbb.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Fcyvggvat ba fcnprf.** Vg zretrf gur 2 fcnprf bs `Bpg  1`, ybfrf gur pbyhzaf naq pnaabg gryy
  gur gvzrfgnzc sebz gur ubfg.
- **Ernqvat cnfg gur raq.** `yvar[v]` jvgu `v == yra(yvar)` cnavpf. Rirel purpx bs "gur arkg olgr"
  arrqf `v < yra(yvar)` svefg. Gur shmm grfg svaqf rirel cynpr lbh sbetbg.
- **`g.Va(abj.Ybpngvba())` vafgrnq bs `gvzr.Qngr(..., abj.Ybpngvba())`.** Vg zbirf gur pybpx ol
  gur mbar bssfrg; gur lrne grfgf va `+01:00` naq `-05:00` pngpu vg.
- **`NqqQngr(1, 0, 0)` naq sevraqf ba n thrffrq qngr.** Zbivat n qngr ol lrnef abeznyvmrf gbb;
  ohvyq gur gvzr ntnva jvgu gur lrne lbh pubfr.
- **Thrffvat gur ubfg.** Gnxvat gur arkg jbeq nf gur ubfg chgf `tchq[311]:` ba gur qnfuobneq. Gur
  jbeq raqvat jvgu `:` vf gur fvtany gung gur ubfg vf zvffvat.
- **Npprcgvat zber guna 3 qvtvgf, be purpxvat gur enatr orsber gur `>`.** `<1234>` vf n sbezng
  ceboyrz ng gur 4gu qvtvg, abg n enatr ceboyrz; gur ERNQZR'f beqre znxrf gur pbyhza rknpg.
- **Ybfvat gur `*gvzr.CnefrReebe`.** `szg.Reebes("%j: %i", ReeGvzrfgnzc, ree)` xrrcf gur zrffntr
  ohg abg gur reebe: `reebef.Nf` pnaabg svaq vg. Hfr `%j` gjvpr.
- **N avy `*CnefrReebe` va na `reebe`.** Ergheavat n glcrq avy cbvagre nf `reebe` tvirf n aba-avy
  vagresnpr. Erghea n yvgreny `avy` ba fhpprff.
- **Sbetrggvat gung `VaqrkOlgr` ba `yvar[v:]` ergheaf n eryngvir vaqrk.**

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **ESP 5424** (2009) ercynprq ESP 3164 jvgu n fgevpgre sbezng:
  `<34>1 2026-10-11G22:14:15.003M zlznpuvar fh - VQ47 - 'fh ebbg' snvyrq`. Vg unf n irefvba, na
  ESP 3339 gvzrfgnzc jvgu lrne, mbar naq senpgvbaf bs n frpbaq, naq `-` sbe n zvffvat svryq, fb
  abobql unf gb thrff. Znal qrivprf fgvyy fraq ESP 3164, fb zbfg erprviref npprcg obgu.
- **Erprviref.** eflfybt, flfybt-at, Syhrag Ovg naq Irpgbe nyy cnefr obgu sbezngf, naq rnpu unf gb
  cvpx n lrne sbe ESP 3164 yvarf. Ybbx hc jung lbhe pbyyrpgbe qbrf orsber lbh gehfg qngrf nebhaq
  1 Wnahnel. N erprvire gung xabjf gur fraqre (gur ybpny fbpxrg, be n xabja VC nqqerff) pna svyy
  va gur ubfg vafgrnq bs erwrpgvat gur yvar; n erynl gung bayl frrf grkg pnaabg.
- **Tb'f `ybt/flfybt`** vf n pyvrag bayl, naq vg vf sebmra. Gb n erzbgr freire vg jevgrf
  `<CEV>` + na ESP 3339 gvzrfgnzc + ubfg + `gnt[cvq]: zft`; gb gur ybpny fbpxrg vg jevgrf
  `gvzr.Fgnzc` naq ab ubfg, orpnhfr gur ybpny qnrzba xabjf gur ubfg. Gung ybpny sbez vf rknpgyl gur
  yvar guvf cnefre erwrpgf.
- **wbheanyq** fgberf gur fnzr svryqf nf fgehpgherq qngn: `CEVBEVGL`, `FLFYBT_SNPVYVGL`,
  `FLFYBT_VQRAGVSVRE` (gur ncc), `FLFYBT_CVQ`, naq n gvzrfgnzc va zvpebfrpbaqf fvapr gur rcbpu.
  Jura lbh pna pubbfr, fgehpgherq ybtf nibvq guvf jubyr cnefre.
- **Frirevgl anzrf.** `rzret` gb `qroht` ner gur xrljbeqf bs `flfybt.pbas` naq bs fryrpgbef fhpu
  nf `*.ree` va eflfybt.

Jung pbzrf arkg: 26-ybtszg vf gur fnzr xvaq bs gnfx jvgu n uneqre tenzzne: xrl=inyhr cnvef,
dhbgrq inyhrf naq rfpncrf, n yriry rahz jvgu nyvnfrf, naq reebef jvgu n pbyhza. Rirelguvat ryfr va
vg lbh unir abj qbar ng yrnfg bapr. 38-ybtzretr yngre chgf yvarf sebz znal fbheprf va gvzr
beqre, juvpu bayl jbexf vs rirel fbhepr tbg vgf lrne evtug.

